__pycache__/    # Python bytecode — harness/hooks are Python
.sf/            # sf CLI project-local state, created by any sf invocation
.sfdx/          # legacy sfdx state, some CLI paths still write it
node_modules/   # Playwright (P4) vendor tree
.venv/          # optional Python virtualenv
knowledge/cache/  # locally-built documentation cache; vendor docs are not redistributable and the DIGESTED catalogue is what ships
.claude/agents/torque-marketing.md  # career-facing drafting agent: encodes the owner's job-search positioning and banned phrasing, which is private context and would also make the artifact read as a marketing exercise
